      "extract": "Prompt injection has been listed as the #1 threat to LLMs and Gen AI applications [8]. Successful attacks have been demonstrated against mainstream LLM agentic products. Prompt injection attacks can exploit AI agents that interact with external content. For example, injected prompts in public documents can cause Google Bard to leak private user conver- sations [7]. Slack’s AI agent [25] can be abused by injecting",
