      "extract": "Several defense strategies have been proposed to mitigate prompt injection attacks. They can be divided into detection- based and prevention-based defenses. Detection-based de- fenses aim to identify prompt injection attempts before their execution and reject potentially malicious queries at test time [41, 42, 43, 44, 45]. More than rejecting queries, prevention-based defenses aim to produce secure responses even",
